From 811a444e50468329e1093c0b960aa694202b1694 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 08:00:10 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Journal on the session's About page; every release on for
 production

As Figma Session/Insights/Journal (16906:5450) draws it, the Journal is
a tab of the session's About page (Chapters, Social Impact, Journal,
Insights), not of Progress: the About page is back in every version
(v4+ had retired it), titled About, reached from the chat menu ('About')
and after a check-in via Open Journal. Progress no longer has a Journal
tab, and v5's own journal is as it was. On request, the Chapter card and
Personal journeys are switched on for production too; v5's analytics
stay as they are.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Je1v64McNyB6XEu6gFgM4C
